    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left[ \\begin{array}{l} y _ {1} (t) \\\\ y _ {2} (t) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & - 1 \\end{array} \\right] \\left[ \\begin{array}{l} \\lambda_ {1} (t) \\\\ \\lambda_ {2} (t) \\end{array} \\right] + \\left[ \\begin{array}{c c} 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{array} \\right] \\left[ \\begin{array}{l} e _ {1} (t) \\\\ e _ {2} (t) \\end{array} \\right]\n$$",
