    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left[ \\begin{array}{l} \\lambda_ {1} (0 _ {-}) \\\\ \\lambda_ {2} (0 _ {-}) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{l} 2 \\\\ - 1 \\end{array} \\right], \\quad \\left[ \\begin{array}{l} e _ {1} (t) \\\\ e _ {2} (t) \\end{array} \\right] = \\left[ \\begin{array}{l} u (t) \\\\ \\delta (t) \\end{array} \\right]\n$$",
